---
description: Invoke the new-hire-guide skill for personalized onboarding tours for a new engineer joining a squad.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user describes onboarding a new engineer (who's joining, which squad — e.g. "onboard Jane, she's
joining payments"), read `new-hire-guide/SKILL.md` and follow it. A plain "who owns X" ownership question
routes to `squad-map/SKILL.md` instead; a full org-wide domain map routes to
`domain-comprehension/SKILL.md` instead.

Phase index: `new-hire-guide/reference/phase-index.md`. Reference loads:
`new-hire-guide/reference/lazy-load-index.md`.
Read-only — no GitLab writes, Datadog mutations, deploys, or application source changes.
